"The Elites is Li Jean's new S-rank-only talent development program, starting that January."
"Li Jean, in Apex, has the largest leveling program there, with bigger gyms than Celena North."
"Invitations come by courier: a letter and a booklet readable only with a code in the letter."
"Elites get private floors, Rabbit maid service, their own cafeteria, tutors and daily gym time."
"It runs three years with no quarters off; most weekends are training intensives."
"Students must show progress toward level S12 by graduation."
"Celena North answered with special classes for S-ranks and top performers, promising more floor time."
"Celena North guarantees its S-ranks at least 90 minutes of S-on-S combat weekly; rank clubs lost time."
"Li Jean holds weekend info sessions and open tryouts for the Elites, then sends callbacks."
